{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X对人物动机和段落转折的因果交代比Y省略，少数地方需要观众自己补出心理联系。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句、重点高亮和话语与感受交替，让观众能迅速抓住每段核心，不必在听音乐时阅读大段叙述；标注到时出现的感受又能跟随音乐逐步进入，不会把所有细节一次性堆在屏幕上。Y的优势是人物心理动因和前后转折解释得更充分，故事读起来更连贯，但较长的叙述在20至38秒的短段中容易占据过多注意力。综合边听边看、抓取重点和音乐感受的具体程度，我更倾向X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "23e8ad52-d9a2-45b4-984d-bc6e36c48ab0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T215527640778Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:56:20.666784+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4a7e54c4eb3f3b48e70061e6d7ea0cacac7260cd7328c01deb14c54e7496dabf", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2